  "releaseNotes": "- Path segments are validated: empty, dot-only, control-character and percent-encoded traversal segments are rejected\n- The storage root cannot be deleted, moved, overwritten or read as a file\n- IFileInfo based move and download URL overloads respect the configured root directory\n- Local file streams upload only to the target they were created for\n- SupportsDownloadUrl tells whether a provider can issue download links\n- Moving an entry onto itself is a no-op",
